WEBVTT

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:33.480
Relationship advice, huh?

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:37.450
Yes! Right now,
I'm facing a major problem!

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:42.080
MIYUKI SHIROGANE
WANTS TO WORK

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:42.080
I thought only you, the Love Master,
would be able to solve this issue!

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.460
The ship has already sailed!

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:49.500
I'll see your voyage through to the end!

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:50.500
President!

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:53.130
<i>Here we go again.</i>

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:55.510
<i>I'm at the end of my rope
for this charade!</i>

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:57.760
<i>How could I ever be thought of
as the Love Master?</i>

00:01:58.050 --> 00:01:59.800
<i>How did I qualify for that title?</i>

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:02.510
<i>If a virgin can qualify,
I'll get it sooner or later!</i>

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:05.020
<i>The idea of me giving
girlfriend advice is ridiculous!</i>

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:07.270
<i>Please, make this an easy one!</i>

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:10.900
<i>That's Miss Kashiwagi's boyfriend.</i>

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:15.780
<i>I thought things were going well with them
doing the charity work together.</i>

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.610
So, what's the problem?

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:21.280
Right. Actually...

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:24.030
I want to hold
Miss Kashiwagi's hand!

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:24.030
BLURT

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:33.420
We've been dating for a month now,
so I'd like to do something romantic.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:37.920
That's why I want your advice
on what I should do to hold hands with her!

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:40.180
<i>Why don't you ask a friend for advice?</i>

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:41.840
<i>Isn't this just bragging?</i>

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:44.430
<i>Did he come to brag,
pretending he wants advice?</i>

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:48.230
<i>The president has a big heart,
but I'm sure even he'll get mad at—</i>

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:51.560
Oh, that.

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:53.440
OH-THAT-ISM

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:53.440
<i>The face of a Buddha?</i>

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:56.400
<i>He brought up something normal.</i>

00:02:56.610 --> 00:03:01.860
<i>Even I can advise about holding hands.
I can handle the ABCs of love.</i>

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:04.580
<i>The ABCs of love!</i>

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:07.040
<i>Of the many kinds of couples,</i>

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:10.080
<i>the meaning between them differs
depending upon the depth of the relationship.</i>

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:13.420
<i>The ABCs are one barometer
to measure that depth.</i>

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:15.880
<i>A is kissing. B is petting.</i>

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.630
<i>C indicates a relationship
that has gone all the way.</i>

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:24.050
<i>This boyfriend is a beginner who decided
to begin climbing the ABC mountain.</i>

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:27.930
<i>The stage he is at differs little
from fellow virgin, Shirogane.</i>

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:31.850
Listen. Holding hands is simple.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:35.270
Rent a cruiser, and as you gaze
at the sun sinking below the horizon,

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:38.230
let your fingertips accidentally
on purpose brush up against hers.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:40.690
When she looks embarrassed,
smile and take her hand.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.320
<i>That's a tall order!</i>

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:44.110
<i>But that's okay.</i>

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:46.450
<i>I guess that's the kind of person
the president is!</i>

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:50.450
I-I don't have the money to rent a cruiser.

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:51.540
I see.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:52.580
Then,

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:54.580
get a part-time job!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.090
A job?

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:57.210
I recommend it.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:00.670
You work up a sweat. I swear, afterwards,
the taste of the water from the fountain...

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:03.010
is as good as cola! I guarantee it!

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:04.970
<i>Why not just drink cola?</i>

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:09.220
<i>The president's workaholism
might be coloring this argument.</i>

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:08.470
I'm not saying you need
to rent a luxury liner.

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:09.220
Right.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.480
You can rent a small one
for 10,000 or 20,000 yen.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.980
But you need to have a license
to pilot a boat, don't you?

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:17.230
A small boat license is good enough.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:20.030
It's easy to get, so I recommend it.

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:20.990
<i>He's got one!</i>

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:24.320
W-Wow! I'm impressed, President!

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:28.490
You can get one by taking a three-day course,
and it costs less than 100,000 yen.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.740
But 100,000 yen is a lot of money to me.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.370
So get a job!

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:34.870
<i>Why do you try to keep pushing him
into the workforce?</i>

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:41.090
Certainly, you're describing a great situation,
but I've got a fundamental problem.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:44.260
My hands get all sweaty
when I'm nervous.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:48.760
I'm afraid to take Miss Kashiwagi's hand
when mine is slick with sweat.

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:50.260
In other words...

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:53.140
you have palmar hyperhidrosis!

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:57.520
PALMAR HYPERHIDROSIS

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:55.520
I don't know what that is,
but you're probably right!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.520
<i>Don't make a diagnosis
before seeing a doctor!</i>

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.860
That would require surgery.

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.280
Surgery for hyperhidrosis
runs about 100,000 yen!

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.910
Get a job! Okay?

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:15.660
TODAY

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:15.660
OGASAWARA

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:15.660
OKINAWA

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:20.500
<i>Why are you obsessed
with making him work?</i>

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.670
Wouldn't it be more constructive...

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:24.420
to have a sweaty forehead from work
than sweaty hands?

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:25.670
<i>That was a pretty good line!</i>

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.260
That decides it.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:30.350
For holding hands,
a part-time job is essential!

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:32.930
<i>Wrong! It isn't essential at all!</i>

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:38.560
As it happens, the place where I work
is looking for people for summer vacation.

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:39.940
Shall I inquire on your behalf?

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:40.940
President...

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:43.360
Don't worry. I'd be with you.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:45.740
It's physical labor. It's tough at first.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:47.280
I'd be there every step of the way.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:48.950
<i>Please, realize your basic mistake!</i>

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.530
President!

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:53.200
The cost of the boat, license and surgery...
We're looking at about 200,000 yen.

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:57.330
The job pays 1,000 yen an hour,
so 5,000 yen for a five-hour shift.

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:59.960
If you work 40 days,
you should be able to swing it.

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:02.090
You'll have a fun summer vacation!

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:04.960
I suppose so.

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:07.340
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:11.140
<i>At this rate, the president's summer vacation
will be consumed by working!</i>

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:13.560
<i>After my trouble coming up
with summer vacation plans!</i>

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.600
<i>They'll all be ruined!</i>

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:19.650
- I'll arrange an interview—
- Hold it!

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:22.150
The color of her magnifying glass is pink!

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:24.530
That's the color of truth!

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:26.690
Enter the Love Detective!

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:29.530
LOVE DETECTIVE CHIKA

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:29.530
Fujiwara and Shinomiya?

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:33.120
I'm not gonna let you
talk about love without me!

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:34.200
Shinomiya...

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:35.290
I'm not part of this!

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.830
I'm not a fool!

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.040
It seems you're together.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.960
So, what's the matter at hand?

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:46.420
Yes, the question was
how he can hold his girlfriend's hand.

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:49.050
I see.

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:55.350
Huh? Can't he just normally
take her by the hand?

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.680
What element is gumming up the works?

00:06:57.680 --> 00:07:01.350
Well, the problematic aspect
is a high psychological hurdle.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.690
Sweaty palms.

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:06.900
After my love sensor went off...

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:10.110
Is that the level
of male relationship advice?

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.910
That's cute.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:13.910
You say it's nothing to worry about?

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:17.410
After all, the only advice here
is "Do your best," right?

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.410
"Do your best"? That's so vague.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:22.170
It's not vague!

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:25.960
He's so nervous that his hands
get sweaty which is embarrassing!

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:28.460
And yet... And yet...

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:34.760
And yet, he screws up the courage,
takes her hand, and it works out.

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:36.310
Right?

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:40.060
It wouldn't be fun if you could
grab her hand without any effort!

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:44.060
Trying to skip the hard part
is a fundamental mistake!

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:45.060
Right?

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.150
Reflect on that!

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:49.190
FWISH

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:51.700
I-I see.

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:54.740
I was just lacking in pure will.

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:57.370
Just trying hard is enough?

00:07:58.490 --> 00:07:59.540
What about the job?

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:00.830
He doesn't need it!

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:01.830
I don't believe it.

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:03.670
I'll do my best!

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:08.050
Although I've never held hands
with a boy myself.

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:09.550
<i>Days later...</i>

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:15.180
<i>On a date with Kashiwagi,</i>

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:18.430
<i>he somehow succeeded
in holding Kashiwagi's hand.</i>

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:24.690
<i>At any rate, I'm glad I protected
the president's summer vacation.</i>

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:28.190
<i>Results of today's match...</i>

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:34.700
RESULTS
OF TODAY'S MATCH:

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:30.360
<i>Shirogane loses.</i>

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:34.700
SHIROGANE LOSES
(FAILED TO RECRUIT A PART-TIMER)

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:32.530
<i>Maybe Shinomiya could work there?</i>

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:34.360
<i>No, dream on.</i>

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:37.700
<i>If he really needs someone
to work there, he should ask me.</i>

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:45.210
Jeez, club activities suck.

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.080
Wha...

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:49.210
Club activities are important.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:53.420
KAGUYA WANTS HIM TO JOIN IN

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:51.840
Dedicating oneself to something
develops the body and mind.

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:55.220
No, I know
that club activities are important.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:59.720
Without them, students would have free time
and go on the path of delinquency.

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:03.100
Juvie, suspension,
the breakdown of the family.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:03.100
MOM
SOB SOB

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:06.900
In the end, they get pregnant,
and we do a fundraising campaign.

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:09.730
Club activities are also a way...

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:13.440
to keep mentally immature children
isolated from all that.

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:15.860
I didn't say that!

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:18.410
I mean, yes, there's that aspect to it.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.120
<i>Club activities!</i>

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:23.750
<i>Two pyramids exist at Shuchiin Academy.</i>

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.580
<i>One is the parentage pyramid.</i>

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:28.080
DAUGHTER OF THE PRESIDENT
OF A MAJOR SHIPBUILDING COMPANY

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:28.080
SON OF A HOSPITAL
DIRECTOR

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:33.090
<i>99% of the students at Shuchiin Academy
come from wealthy families.</i>

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:32.210
DAUGHTER OF THE PRESIDENT
OF AN ADVERTISING AGENCY

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:32.210
DAUGHTER
OF A SHINOMIYA
GROUP DIRECTOR

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:32.210
DAUGHTER OF
THE PRESIDENT
OF A FAMOUS I.T. COMPANY

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:35.090
<i>Therefore, this is
the ensuing balance of power.</i>

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:38.220
ALL OTHERS
(GENERAL PUBLIC)

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:38.220
DOCTORS, PRESIDENTS OF
MEDIUM-SIZED CORPORATIONS,
PRO SPORTS ATHLETES

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:38.220
<i>It could be called
the "Social Standing Hierarchy."</i>

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:38.220
GOVERNMENT OFFICIALS,
EXECUTIVES OF LARGE
CORPORATIONS

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:38.220
WORLD-FAMOUS

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:38.220
PRIVILEGED CLASS

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:44.230
SPORTS
TABLE TENNIS
CULTURAL
NO CLUB
MANGA CLUB (ANIME CLUB)

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:41.470
<i>And the other pyramid...</i>

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:44.230
<i>The Club Caste!</i>

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:48.940
<i>Anyone affiliated with a sports club alone
may be popular,</i>

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.360
<i>regardless of actual performance
during club activities.</i>

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:52.150
BENCHWARMER

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:56.150
<i>Students who belong to no club
or cultural club members...</i>

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:59.320
<i>feel negatively about
this unreasonable state of affairs.</i>

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:02.330
Those who are serious about it
are okay in my book.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:07.750
But don't the majority put on "We're serious"
faces while pretending to be best buddies?

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.670
That's a really cold thing.

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:13.670
It's like, what's fun about that?

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:16.170
They should do it
as if their lives depended on it!

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:17.760
I swear...

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:20.720
I wish they would all die.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:24.850
<i>Shoot. Ishigami is off
on one of his anti-youth rants.</i>

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:27.430
<i>I have to get him back on topic somehow.</i>

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:30.980
Well, let's put a pin in that.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:32.940
About the club budget draft...

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:34.610
With the recent recession,

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:38.780
2019 STUDENT COUNCIL
(CLUB SPONSORSHIP)
TREASURY BUDGET DRAFT

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:36.570
contributions are down.

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:39.860
We'll have to cut club budgets
wherever we can.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.870
I definitely want to hear
your opinion as treasurer.

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.740
Well, let's see.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.750
Going from my experience
doing accounting for the family business,

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:48.210
NOTE: SON OF THE PRESIDENT
OF A TOY MANUFACTURING
COMPANY

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:50.960
I have to say there's a lot of waste
in this proposed budget.

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:54.550
We should probably slash
the soccer club's budget.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:57.840
Okay, why?

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.800
A lot of the members have girlfriends.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:00.970
That's your reason?

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:05.510
For the same reason, let's reduce the
basketball club and the baseball club's budgets.

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:07.730
How about a 50,000 yen reduction
for every couple?

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:08.850
Taxing couples?

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:11.810
Shouldn't those who are happy
be taxed the most?

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:13.270
It's a happiness tax.

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:18.030
Even a tyrant wouldn't tax like that!
That's just a total personal grudge!

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:22.780
It is a personal grudge,
but is that so bad?

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:24.990
It is bad! It's really bad!

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:27.660
You don't understand, President.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:30.290
You don't understand my feelings!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:34.540
<i>Hey, you don't have a game
this Sunday, do you?</i>

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:37.300
<i>It's been a while, so let's go somewhere!</i>

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:39.510
<i>Sorry. We have practice that day.</i>

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:41.760
<i>Lately all you do is practice!</i>

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:44.720
<i>Sorry, but the tournament's coming up.</i>

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:47.010
<i>I know, but...</i>

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:49.730
<i>Right now,</i>

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:53.020
<i>I'm putting it all on the line for soccer.</i>

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:54.480
<i>Tak...</i>

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:55.520
THROB

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:59.030
You burst into tears?

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:01.650
It's okay with me
that they have girlfriends.

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:05.120
I'm so used to it that I don't feel
anything about it at this point.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.540
If you've got a girlfriend, go on a date!

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:09.500
Why are you even at practice?

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:14.250
If you've got a precious girlfriend,
what could be more important than her?

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:19.340
When I have nothing...

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:24.010
L-Look, you know a lot about computers.

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:26.850
Everyone says the same thing to otaku.

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:29.930
Maybe you should join one of those clubs.

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:32.640
Is it possible to be in a club
and also do student council?

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:35.900
Well, Shinomiya and Fujiwara do it,

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:37.480
so it's not impossible.

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:40.150
I see. What clubs are they in?

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:44.110
I believe Fujiwara belongs
to the tabletop game club.

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.910
I can imagine her enjoying that.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:52.790
Shinomiya is in the Japanese archery club.

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.250
The Japanese archery club?

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:56.960
That really suits her.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:12:59.000
How do you mean?

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:00.880
With Japanese archery,

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:04.630
if you've got breasts, the bowstring
rubs against them when you pull it back.

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:08.800
But with Shinomiya-senpai's size,
there's no need to worry about that.

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:10.010
She's like this.

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:11.600
- Ishigami!
- Just like this.

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:12.520
Behind you! Behind you!

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:15.600
FWISH FWISH

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:16.770
RUMBLE RUMBLE

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.310
Ishigami!

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:16.770
Ishigami!

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:20.270
I hear it's possible to bind your boobs
with bandages up to D cup.

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:23.530
I'm sure Fujiwara-senpai
is way bigger than that,

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:27.530
so the day she tried Japanese archery,
her chest would be knocked all over the place!

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:29.780
They'd be like this!

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:31.330
WOBBLE WOBBLE

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:33.120
RUMBLE RUMBLE

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:30.910
Like this!

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:33.120
Hit the brakes, Ishigami!

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:35.120
Ishigami?

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:44.970
GRIN

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:49.430
FWAP FWAP

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:54.060
You're lucky, Ishigami.

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:58.190
Miss Fujiwara is kind,
so she'll forgive you.

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:01.770
She's probably the only one
who'd forgive you.

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:05.070
RUMBLE RUMBLE

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.820
I'm sure of it.

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:08.990
President, I'm going home
to write my will.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.370
S-Sure.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:12.080
But don't die.

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:18.830
It was a life full of liking
big ones and small ones.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.830
Were you two at your clubs?

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:22.090
Yes.

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:25.840
President, please increase
the budget of the tabletop game club.

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:27.720
I'll give you a cola.

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:28.970
DAUGHTER OF
A POLITICIAN

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:30.090
Don't offer me such an obvious bribe.

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:35.060
But I've never been in a club,
so I don't know what it's like.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:36.850
Really?

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:40.940
<i>Then, you should join my club.</i>

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:43.110
<i>No! If I said that,</i>

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:46.530
<i>it'd be like saying I wanted to be
in the same club as the president!</i>

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:49.110
<i>I'm not really that...</i>

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:53.780
Then why don't you try joining my club?

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:55.870
<i>Tabletop game club, huh?</i>

00:14:56.330 --> 00:15:00.250
President, the budgets for the cultural clubs
haven't changed much.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:03.000
If you're there to observe
as a member of student council,

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:06.670
then logically, the sports clubs have had
the major budget changes.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.720
No, my club is special!

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:12.050
We always buy new games,
so it's like a money pit!

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.350
That doesn't endear me.

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:15.760
My club! Please join my club!

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:16.600
No!

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.890
You can't, no.

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:24.900
<i>Well, I don't really have time
to join a club because of my part-time job.</i>

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:29.650
<i>But I like this situation.
It feels like I'm popular.</i>

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:30.990
<i>I won't tell them I can't!</i>

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:34.660
<i>Results of today's match...</i>

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:37.910
RESULTS OF TODAY'S MATCH:
SHIROGANE WINS

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:37.040
<i>Shirogane wins.</i>

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:37.910
BECAUSE FOR A SHORT TIME,
HE'S ABLE TO FEEL LIKE HE HAS A HAREM

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:43.920
I WANNA BE POPULAR.
I WANNA BE POPULAR.

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:43.920
PSYCHOANALYSIS

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:49.170
So, Pesu put Father's shoe
in his mouth and ran off.

00:15:49.470 --> 00:15:53.840
Father chased after him, yelling,
"I'm not bread from Shizuoka Prefecture!"

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:54.140
KAGUYA WANTS TO CONTROL IT

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:56.510
I held my sides with laughter!

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:08.440
I love how you laugh, Miss Kaguya.

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:11.200
Wh-Where's that coming from?

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:15.320
After all, a long time ago,
you didn't even crack a smile!

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:19.040
When we were in middle school,
they called you "Kaguya the Ice Princess."

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:21.410
It was like you were in your own world.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:23.830
I was like that back then, wasn't I?

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:29.380
After joining the student council, you were
on bad terms with the president for a while.

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:33.050
<i>Shirogane, would you not look at me?</i>

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:35.640
<i>You were looking at me first.</i>

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:39.100
It was as comfortable
as sitting on thorns back then.

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:43.190
I-It was like that back then, wasn't it?

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:47.520
<i>I kept my distance from people
because I was afraid.</i>

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:50.480
<i>Miss Fujiwara was the only one
who stayed by my side despite that.</i>

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:55.870
<i>I have to treat her better.</i>

00:16:57.280 --> 00:17:02.120
It's my dream to see you
roar with laughter someday!

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:06.420
I wouldn't let myself
lose control like that.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:08.040
That's what you say,

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:12.340
but I bet you'd laugh
if you saw my Pesu doing tricks.

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:13.760
It's amazing!

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:15.630
His wiener!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:20.970
Is something wrong, Miss Kaguya?

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:24.390
I-I understand!
You mean your dog's trick, right?

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:27.610
Perhaps you balance a hot dog on his nose,
and he waits for a command to eat it.

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:29.320
I knew it!

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:33.150
<i>But I was just shocked
to hear the word "wiener"...</i>

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:35.910
Anyway, he does the normal trick
like putting one or two paws in your hand,

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:35.910
<i>suddenly coming out of the mouth
of a cute girl like Miss Fujiwara!</i>

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:38.160
but his wiener is really weird!

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:41.330
How can I explain it?

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:43.910
It hangs all the way to the left!

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:47.670
M-Miss Kaguya?

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:50.920
Sorry. I choked on my tea.

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:53.670
SHIVER SHIVER

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:53.210
<i>Wh-What is this?</i>

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:55.880
<i>Why am I laughing
when I hear the word "wiener"?</i>

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:57.430
<i>Dirty jokes!</i>

00:17:57.430 --> 00:18:01.220
EASY
PHYSICAL EDUCATION

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.720
<i>After learning from past mistakes,</i>

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:02.350
<i>Kaguya has begun to study the facts of life.</i>

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:03.060
HMM HMM

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:03.060
<i>However,</i>

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:09.270
<i>regarding slang and metaphors, Kaguya's knowledge
is still at the level of a young grade-schooler.</i>

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:11.770
But Pesu is sneaky!

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:15.690
His wiener gets big when there's food,
but otherwise, it's just a tiny stump!

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:19.110
NORMAL

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:19.110
<i>So, right now,</i>

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:20.120
SMALL

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:22.870
<i>Kaguya is at the stage where kids laugh
at words like "wiener" and "boobs"!</i>

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:21.120
BIG

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:21.990
NORMAL

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:22.870
SMALL

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:23.740
BIG

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:26.620
<i>Everyone goes through this period,
and Kaguya is smack-dab in the middle of it!</i>

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:24.620
NORMAL

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:25.500
SMALL

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:26.620
BIG

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:29.920
Kaguya?

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:31.880
Stop it already!

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:36.050
<i>If she realizes I'm laughing
at a vulgar word like that,</i>

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:37.880
<i>the Shinomiya family
will never live down my shame!</i>

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:43.220
<i>It's my dream to see you
roar with laughter someday.</i>

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:43.890
<i>Making Miss Fujiwara's dream come true
with a wiener would just be despicable!</i>

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:47.640
<i>I have to reset my feelings!</i>

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:53.190
Are you...

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.400
Wiener.

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:08.660
Wiener.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.420
Please! Stop it!

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:13.090
I'm begging you!

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:16.800
M-Miss Kaguya is roaring with laughter!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:18.340
<i>I'm thrilled!</i>

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:20.050
<i>Fujiwara's dream came true.</i>

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:22.220
M-Miss Fujiwara?

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:24.310
You will stop, won't you?

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:26.060
<i>Of course she wouldn't stop.</i>

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:26.810
WILLIE THE ELEPHANT
NICE TO MEET YOU!

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:29.390
<i>Just as a parent
will continue tickling their child...</i>

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:29.810
Wiener! Wiener! Wiener! Wiener!

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:32.020
<i>when the child demands them to stop,</i>

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:35.570
<i>nothing could make
the overjoyed Fujiwara stop!</i>

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:37.230
This is fun!

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:40.150
<i>President?</i>

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:43.280
Hi.

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:45.030
President.

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:50.040
Listen, Miss Fujiwara!
Don't you dare do that in front of a boy!

00:19:51.170 --> 00:19:53.420
GRIN

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:53.420
<i>She's not going to stop!</i>

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:56.250
It'll be okay. I'm a young lady.

00:19:56.710 --> 00:19:59.420
I could never say that word
in front of a boy.

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:02.510
At least not out of my mouth.

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:04.930
<i>No! There's some hidden meaning
to her words!</i>

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:07.390
Say, President!

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:11.060
What do you call that little dog
that looks like a sausage again?

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:12.350
Dachshund?

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:14.310
<i>Wiener dog?</i>

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:17.440
<i>She intends to make
the president say "wiener"!</i>

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:20.070
<i>If the president says that word,</i>

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:23.570
<i>I won't be able to keep myself
from laughing!</i>

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:26.410
<i>I can't let the president say "wiener"!</i>

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:27.830
But isn't there
another weird expression for it?

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:28.580
<i>I gotta stop this!</i>

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:29.830
<i>Think!</i>

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:33.370
<i>Use all of your brain cells, Kaguya Shinomiya!</i>

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:36.920
Oh, isn't it "wien"—

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:38.090
Hot dog!

00:20:39.510 --> 00:20:41.840
I heard that's what they sometimes
call it in the U.S.

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:47.930
What's that Viennese breaded,
pan-fried cutlet called?

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:49.470
- Wien—
- Schnitzel.

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:51.730
It's similar to our tonkatsu.

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:53.890
What's the common name for a hot dog?

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:55.190
- Wie—
- Frankfurter!

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:58.770
The term comes from Frankfurt, Germany,
where sausages like hot dogs originated.

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:03.150
Um, what else? What else?
I can't think of anything!

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:05.410
What? What is this about?

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:06.620
<i>I held the fort!</i>

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:10.660
<i>Now the president won't say the word "wiener"!</i>

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:12.790
<i>I'm out of danger!</i>

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:18.500
Darn it! President, I wanted "wiener"
to come out of your mouth!

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:23.420
Every time you were about to give me "wiener,"
Miss Kaguya would get in the way!

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:24.880
P-Perverts!

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.720
I would never do anything like that here!
What in the world are you thinking?

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:32.180
Are you nymphos?

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:34.850
Are you nymphomaniacs?

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:34.850
I...

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:38.980
I'm not like her!

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:43.240
Why...

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:45.780
is this happening?

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:50.370
Wiener.

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:50.370
BFFT

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:52.240
Enough! Stop it already!

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:54.870
That's too funny!

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:57.080
I've had enough wieners!

00:21:57.080 --> 00:21:59.880
Miss Fujiwara,
when are you going to be satisfied?

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:02.340
Stop torturing me with wieners!

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:05.380
Miss Kaguya, your response
just makes me feel so good.

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:06.010
<i>S-Something unspeakable
is happening behind this door!</i>

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:07.550
Why don't we switch?
You take the wiener part!

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:10.510
No way! You won't see that
come out of my mouth!

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:13.470
Oh, like you never have before!

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:15.270
One or two more wieners won't hurt!

00:22:15.270 --> 00:22:16.350
Forget it!

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:17.350
Wiener!

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:19.770
Wiener! Wiener!

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:21.520
<i>Results of today's match...</i>

00:22:21.520 --> 00:22:23.320
<i>Fujiwara wins.</i>

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:25.110
Wiener!

00:22:26.320 --> 00:22:29.320
Um, do you have one?
